{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"イオンツアー3日目in滋賀ー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びわこ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うばがもち!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひこにゃあーん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(o>ω<o)!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/25/7714237/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーわけで1日滋賀を満喫してきたであります。ちなみに宿泊は京都♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関西ばんざい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来て下さった方ありがとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいつものハーフアップにカールを入れてみまーした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのみんなからは好評だったです(^^)ひめたん的にも好きー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん的にどうですかー?みなさんの意見を募集しちゃうお。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ゆーて、写メがどあっぷだから伝わりにくいかもしれない('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イオンモール草津さん、ありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もお客さんの数いーぱいで高山っ(ω)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方と握手できて楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中休憩挟んじゃってごめんなさいっ('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげさまで最後まで元気に握手できたよーありがとうございました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/25/7714237/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の学校は楽しめましたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},