ak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/25/7714237/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ひめかサンプラー」わざとひめたんの好きそうなものだけ質問して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと「好き」「好き」って言わせてもいいのかな?笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーれはあなたにおまかせですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好き好き言ってほしいのー(*^^*)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあんまり言い過ぎると照れるのでほどほどに。うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/25/7714237/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんがあのPVで恥ずかしかったセリフとかあったんっ?笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしやひめたんに言わせようとしてますねー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃご想像におまかせしますよもう(//ω//)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/25/7714237/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはアクセサリーや帽子は身につける?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネックレスはよくしてるし、いろんなの持ってる∩^ω^∩☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帽子はあんましないかなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフアップとかしてると帽子かぶれないからね←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リボンするの(∞・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/25/7714237/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プロフィール写真の髪型(ツインテール)はひめたん自身で決めたのですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだったかな。いろんな人にアンケート取っ